Author:     Lukas Mandrake <lukas.mandrake@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Mon Nov 2 18:32:54 2026 -0800
Commit:     Lukas Mandrake <lukas.mandrake@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Mon Nov 2 18:33:22 2026 -0800

    PUMP_ON_TANK_FIX_NO_COUPLER: machine coupler on the 2x2 tank's drawn nozzle, drop pipe under the pump

    The 2x2 RM_LiquidTank draws one nozzle per W/E side (TankPortGeometry), half a cell off a 1x1 pump's port;
    LiquidJoinRule.MachineTankJoin puts the coupler there and an S-bend drop at pipe altitude joins the two.
    Live proof: FlowWorks/prove_pump_tank_coupler.py (RM_LiquidJoins.ProofMachineCouplers via jawa/static_call).

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

